# {{proscribed}} {{irregular plural of|[[virus]]}}
# {{computing|nonstandard}} A superset of computer software composed of computer [[virus|viruses]], [[trojan|trojans]], and [[worms]].

====Usage notes====
*The plural {{term|virii}}, though common, is incorrect, and based on a misunderstanding of Latin. There is no plural for the Latin word {{term|virus|lang=la}}; using the native English pluralisation rules, to yield ''viruses'', would arguably then be most correct.

